Sakura wallpaper
================

Photograph: "Cherry blossom trees in full bloom over a canal with pink
lanterns", Meguro river, Tokyo, Japan.

Photographer: Crystal Kay (@xtalkay)
Source:       https://unsplash.com/photos/7viWpO0fNss
Licence:      Unsplash License -- https://unsplash.com/license

The Unsplash License permits commercial use and redistribution without
permission or attribution. Attribution is recorded here anyway: it costs
nothing, and a distribution that cannot say where its assets came from is a
distribution nobody can audit.

The shipped files are resized and cropped from the original. The 16:10 and
4:3 variants are cropped toward the top of the frame rather than the centre,
because the subject is the blossom canopy and a centre crop lands on the
empty canal.
